WEBVTT

00:09.727 --> 00:10.807
<b>[RAM]
Barusu.</b>

00:10.857 --> 00:12.397
<b>How long will you sleep?</b>

00:12.437 --> 00:13.517
<b>It's time to wake up already.</b>

00:13.557 --> 00:14.527
<b>Barusu.</b>

00:14.567 --> 00:16.357
<b>[yelps]</b>

00:17.317 --> 00:18.607
<b>Where are we?</b>

00:18.647 --> 00:20.947
<b>[RAM] The air around
us is still and cool.</b>

00:20.987 --> 00:23.777
<b>We're most likely underground.</b>

00:23.827 --> 00:25.197
<b>[SUBARU]
Ram?</b>

00:25.237 --> 00:27.537
<b>Underground as in--</b>

00:27.577 --> 00:29.207
<b>Beneath the dunes.</b>

00:29.247 --> 00:31.457
<b>If you believe what
Ms. Beatrice was theorizing</b>

00:31.497 --> 00:32.997
<b>before we were separated,</b>

00:33.037 --> 00:35.837
<b>it's likely because of
a distortion in space.</b>

00:35.877 --> 00:38.087
<b>And that's what sent us
all plummeting down here?</b>

00:38.127 --> 00:39.467
<b>Wait, separated?</b>

00:39.507 --> 00:42.217
<b>Hold on, where
is everyone else?</b>

00:42.257 --> 00:45.347
<b>It seems like it's only you
and me here, so what happened?</b>

00:45.387 --> 00:47.637
<b>I'm not sure why
you're asking me.</b>

00:48.847 --> 00:52.267
<b>[rumbling]</b>

00:52.307 --> 00:53.727
<b>[gripping music]</b>

00:53.767 --> 00:56.057
<b>[gasps]</b>

00:56.107 --> 01:02.987
<b>♪ ♪</b>

01:04.367 --> 01:07.617
<b>[RAM] I don't see any sign
of Ms. Emilia or Ms. Beatrice.</b>

01:07.657 --> 01:09.827
<b>You really blew it this time.</b>

01:09.867 --> 01:11.497
<b>I don't need
your sass right now.</b>

01:11.537 --> 01:12.867
<b>We have to go find the others.</b>

01:12.917 --> 01:13.877
<b>No, wait.</b>

01:13.917 --> 01:14.917
<b>Where's Rem?</b>

01:14.957 --> 01:16.207
<b>Barusu.</b>

01:16.247 --> 01:17.957
<b>We need to find
everyone, obviously,</b>

01:18.007 --> 01:19.707
<b>but Rem is
the priority for now.</b>

01:19.757 --> 01:21.797
<b>She's not even able
to move on her own.</b>

01:21.837 --> 01:23.007
<b>We gotta go.</b>

01:23.047 --> 01:24.467
<b>We have to find her, and quick!</b>

01:24.507 --> 01:25.887
<b>[RAM]
Barusu, you need to calm down.</b>

01:25.927 --> 01:27.097
<b>Calm down?</b>

01:27.137 --> 01:29.217
<b>You expect me
to calm down, really?</b>

01:29.267 --> 01:31.807
<b>What, do you not even
care that Rem's in danger?</b>

01:31.847 --> 01:33.687
<b>You know that's not true!</b>

01:37.397 --> 01:38.477
<b>You're right.</b>

01:38.527 --> 01:40.397
<b>Sorry, I mean it.</b>

01:40.437 --> 01:41.777
<b>I was being an idiot.</b>

01:41.817 --> 01:43.357
<b>Honestly, a total jerkwad.</b>

01:44.947 --> 01:46.567
<b>That's nothing new.</b>

01:46.617 --> 01:49.697
<b>Anyway, I can feel the
faint link I share with Rem.</b>

01:49.737 --> 01:52.197
<b>I still don't have
any idea where she is,</b>

01:52.247 --> 01:54.367
<b>but I can tell
she's alive at least.</b>

01:54.417 --> 01:56.167
<b>That's right,
I forgot, you're twins,</b>

01:56.207 --> 01:57.787
<b>so you have synesthesia.</b>

01:57.837 --> 01:59.837
<b>[ANASTASIA] Natsuki, finally
bright eyed and bushy tailed,</b>

01:59.877 --> 02:01.047
<b>are ya?</b>

02:01.087 --> 02:03.837
<b>[SUBARU]
Lady Anastasia and Patrasche.</b>

02:03.877 --> 02:06.837
<b>Sorry I went and borrowed
her without your permission.</b>

02:06.887 --> 02:09.467
<b>I may be a gutsy gal,
but not enough to go</b>

02:09.507 --> 02:11.887
<b>looking around here
all on my lonesome.</b>

02:11.927 --> 02:14.227
<b>I mean, I don't have
a problem with that, but--</b>

02:14.267 --> 02:16.937
<b>I never said anything about
it being just the two of us</b>

02:16.977 --> 02:18.147
<b>alone here.</b>

02:18.187 --> 02:19.817
<b>How did the surroundings look?</b>

02:19.857 --> 02:21.027
<b>Not promising.</b>

02:21.067 --> 02:22.487
<b>I wasn't able to find an exit,</b>

02:22.527 --> 02:24.397
<b>and none of the others
seemed close by.</b>

02:24.447 --> 02:25.947
<b>Looks like just
the three of us</b>

02:25.987 --> 02:27.817
<b>were sent to this
particular area.</b>

02:27.867 --> 02:30.787
<b>Oh, and I couldn't forget
Patrasche, of course.</b>

02:30.827 --> 02:32.697
<b>We're the only
ones here, then?</b>

02:32.747 --> 02:35.037
<b>[RAM]
No point in crying over it.</b>

02:35.077 --> 02:37.627
<b>Now that Barusu
the useless is awake,</b>

02:37.667 --> 02:40.207
<b>let's look for Rem
and Ms. Emilia.</b>

02:40.247 --> 02:42.207
<b>What, just go
out there blindly?</b>

02:42.257 --> 02:44.917
<b>The universe is laughing at us
with this team formation.</b>

02:44.967 --> 02:48.427
<b>In case you haven't noticed,
none of us can fight!</b>

02:48.467 --> 02:53.097
<b>[theme music]</b>

02:53.137 --> 03:00.437
<b>♪ ♪</b>

04:20.517 --> 04:23.897
<b>I think maybe
I can feel a breeze.</b>

04:23.937 --> 04:25.267
<b>Or maybe not.</b>

04:26.937 --> 04:29.027
<b>[RAM] Can't you speak
with spirits, Barusu?</b>

04:29.067 --> 04:31.527
<b>[SUBARU] Asking the lesser
spirits to guide us, huh?</b>

04:31.567 --> 04:34.907
<b>Problem with that is my link
with Beako is so strong,</b>

04:34.947 --> 04:37.447
<b>all of them are too
scared to deal with me.</b>

04:37.497 --> 04:38.997
<b>[RAM] You're more
the living embodiment</b>

04:39.037 --> 04:41.957
<b>of Ms. Beatrice's pity
than a real magician,</b>

04:41.997 --> 04:44.037
<b>so I had no expectations.</b>

04:44.087 --> 04:45.497
<b>[grumbles]</b>

04:45.547 --> 04:46.627
<b>[ANASTASIA]
Natsuki.</b>

04:46.667 --> 04:48.047
<b>Huh?</b>

04:48.087 --> 04:50.257
<b>She's trying to be brave
and hide it from you,</b>

04:50.297 --> 04:52.887
<b>but really, right after
we tumbled into this place</b>

04:52.927 --> 04:55.807
<b>and before you woke up,
Ram was pretty beside herself,</b>

04:55.847 --> 04:58.677
<b>not being able
to see Rem around.</b>

04:58.717 --> 04:59.977
<b>She panicked?</b>

05:00.017 --> 05:01.477
<b>[ANASTASIA]
All that to say,</b>

05:01.517 --> 05:03.057
<b>you're playing a big
part in keeping her</b>

05:03.107 --> 05:05.107
<b>emotionally stable
through this.</b>

05:05.147 --> 05:07.397
<b>You ain't useless
in the slightest.</b>

05:11.487 --> 05:13.277
<b>[SUBARU]
The path splits here.</b>

05:13.317 --> 05:14.867
<b>Well, that's frustrating.</b>

05:14.907 --> 05:16.447
<b>Feels purposeful too.</b>

05:16.487 --> 05:17.617
<b>What do we do?</b>

05:17.657 --> 05:19.157
<b>According to my knowledge,</b>

05:19.197 --> 05:20.907
<b>it's best to listen to
Freud in times like these</b>

05:20.957 --> 05:22.077
<b>and go right always.</b>

05:22.117 --> 05:23.167
<b>Who's that?</b>

05:23.207 --> 05:24.577
<b>Apparently,
behavioral studies</b>

05:24.627 --> 05:26.167
<b>suggest that humans
tend to default</b>

05:26.207 --> 05:27.917
<b>to choosing the left option.</b>

05:27.957 --> 05:30.257
<b>And so,
my strong sense of justice</b>

05:30.297 --> 05:32.087
<b>tells me to check
the right one instead.</b>

05:32.127 --> 05:34.387
<b>You really seem
to trust this Freud a lot.</b>

05:34.427 --> 05:36.427
<b>Again, who the heck is that?</b>

05:37.677 --> 05:42.597
<b>[exciting music]</b>

05:42.637 --> 05:47.147
<b>♪ ♪</b>

05:47.187 --> 05:53.987
<b>Uh-- a door?</b>

05:54.817 --> 05:56.567
<b>It's huge and it
looks thick too.</b>

05:56.617 --> 05:58.277
<b>Can we even move it?</b>

05:58.327 --> 06:00.577
<b>[ANASTASIA] For starters, it
looks completely sealed shut,</b>

06:00.617 --> 06:01.997
<b>so it'd be tough.</b>

06:02.037 --> 06:05.037
<b>But also, Natsuki,
I wondered what makes you</b>

06:05.077 --> 06:07.037
<b>think this is a door anyway?</b>

06:07.077 --> 06:10.167
<b>It just looks like a plain old
iron wall to me, nothing more.</b>

06:10.207 --> 06:11.167
<b>Huh?</b>

06:11.207 --> 06:12.337
<b>[RAM]
Agreed.</b>

06:12.377 --> 06:13.547
<b>It's scrap.</b>

06:13.587 --> 06:15.427
<b>Just an obstacle
blocking my path.</b>

06:15.467 --> 06:18.217
<b>I-- I just can't help
but think it kind of looked</b>

06:18.257 --> 06:20.137
<b>like it was a door, you know.</b>

06:22.347 --> 06:25.557
<b>[mysterious music]</b>

06:27.267 --> 06:28.267
<b>Huh?</b>

06:28.317 --> 06:29.937
<b>What was that just now?</b>

06:29.977 --> 06:31.857
<b>Natsuki,
did you do something?</b>

06:31.897 --> 06:32.897
<b>Did I?</b>

06:32.937 --> 06:34.697
<b>You were watching, right?</b>

06:34.737 --> 06:36.107
<b>All I did was touch it.</b>

06:36.157 --> 06:37.527
<b>I didn't do anything special,</b>

06:37.567 --> 06:39.447
<b>so I don't know
what happened either.</b>

06:39.487 --> 06:41.077
<b>Let's keep going.</b>

06:42.117 --> 06:43.157
<b>[SUBARU]
Patrasche.</b>

06:43.197 --> 06:45.537
<b>[growls]</b>

06:45.577 --> 06:47.287
<b>I understand
it's scary right now</b>

06:47.327 --> 06:49.247
<b>and that you're
trying to protect us,</b>

06:49.287 --> 06:50.747
<b>but nothing down here's safe.</b>

06:50.797 --> 06:52.627
<b>That's just the situation.</b>

06:52.667 --> 06:53.917
<b>That means we
need to be prepared</b>

06:53.957 --> 06:55.757
<b>to take risks at some point.</b>

06:55.797 --> 06:58.677
<b>And there's no better
time than now, OK?</b>

06:58.717 --> 07:00.717
<b>[growls]</b>

07:00.757 --> 07:02.387
<b>She's got you whipped,
hasn't she?</b>

07:02.427 --> 07:04.017
<b>Listen, if there's
got to be whipping</b>

07:04.057 --> 07:05.557
<b>between me and a woman,</b>

07:05.597 --> 07:07.557
<b>I'd rather be the one
who's getting whipped,</b>

07:07.597 --> 07:08.557
<b>you know?</b>

07:08.607 --> 07:09.767
<b>Gross.</b>

07:09.807 --> 07:11.897
<b>[SUBARU]
I didn't mean it like that.</b>

07:11.937 --> 07:13.687
<b>[sighs]</b>

07:17.107 --> 07:19.157
<b>The second time
this has happened.</b>

07:19.197 --> 07:21.987
<b>Both of 'em just disappeared
when I touched 'em.</b>

07:22.027 --> 07:23.907
<b>What's the point
of walls that don't stop</b>

07:23.947 --> 07:25.787
<b>anyone from going through 'em?</b>

07:25.827 --> 07:27.657
<b>Uh, what's up?</b>

07:27.707 --> 07:29.707
<b>Oh, well,
we haven't seen any,</b>

07:29.747 --> 07:31.997
<b>so it makes sense we
didn't consider it before.</b>

07:32.047 --> 07:35.087
<b>But perhaps those walls were
created to stop mabeasts.</b>

07:35.127 --> 07:36.757
<b>There's also
a non-zero chance</b>

07:36.797 --> 07:39.797
<b>that this could be connected
to a sandworm's tunnel.</b>

07:39.837 --> 07:42.347
<b>So it would make sense
that they're for mabeasts.</b>

07:42.387 --> 07:43.717
<b>[SUBARU]
Don't like that.</b>

07:43.757 --> 07:46.887
<b>If you're right,
that's freaking terrifying.</b>

07:46.937 --> 07:49.847
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

07:49.897 --> 07:57.197
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:03.617 --> 08:07.077
<b>Anyone else starting
to feel weirdly heavy?</b>

08:07.117 --> 08:09.167
<b>[groans]</b>

08:10.377 --> 08:13.627
<b>But I guess now isn't
the time to start whining.</b>

08:13.667 --> 08:16.667
<b>Sure, it's a little hard
to walk, but I can keep going.</b>

08:16.707 --> 08:17.797
<b>No big deal.</b>

08:17.837 --> 08:19.127
<b>If we can keep up this pace,</b>

08:19.177 --> 08:20.757
<b>then we might
reach our goal faster.</b>

08:20.797 --> 08:23.007
<b>[RAM]
Barusu, shut up.</b>

08:23.047 --> 08:24.887
<b>Uh, OK.</b>

08:24.927 --> 08:28.227
<b>It just seems so boring
to not say a single thing</b>

08:28.267 --> 08:29.597
<b>the whole entire time.</b>

08:29.637 --> 08:31.807
<b>You think it's a fun
stroll through the park?</b>

08:31.857 --> 08:33.517
<b>We all need to stay focused.</b>

08:33.557 --> 08:34.937
<b>I know, but--</b>

08:34.977 --> 08:37.277
<b>[ANASTASIA] Hey, now,
Natsuki, that's enough.</b>

08:37.317 --> 08:39.107
<b>Read the room, will ya?</b>

08:39.147 --> 08:40.987
<b>When people are already
feeling on edge,</b>

08:41.027 --> 08:42.657
<b>continuing
to push their buttons</b>

08:42.697 --> 08:44.947
<b>is just gonna dig you
a bigger hole, I'm afraid,</b>

08:44.987 --> 08:46.497
<b>you know?</b>

08:49.407 --> 08:52.667
<b>[water draining]</b>

08:54.917 --> 08:57.297
<b>[pounding]</b>

08:57.337 --> 08:58.297
<b>Damn it!</b>

08:58.337 --> 08:59.257
<b>Why now?</b>

08:59.297 --> 09:01.007
<b>What the hell?</b>

09:01.047 --> 09:03.387
<b>They already let us pass
through three doors no problem.</b>

09:03.427 --> 09:06.177
<b>Why get in our way after
we've come this far?</b>

09:06.217 --> 09:07.557
<b>Why?</b>

09:07.597 --> 09:08.557
<b>Oh, damn it.</b>

09:08.597 --> 09:10.427
<b>Damn it all.</b>

09:10.477 --> 09:11.887
<b>Natsuki,
that's enough.</b>

09:11.937 --> 09:13.557
<b>It's not gonna
make a difference.</b>

09:13.597 --> 09:16.357
<b>No matter how you look at it,
we've run into a dead end.</b>

09:16.397 --> 09:17.607
<b>I know that.</b>

09:17.647 --> 09:19.897
<b>Stating the obvious
doesn't help us!</b>

09:19.937 --> 09:21.897
<b>[gasps]</b>

09:21.947 --> 09:24.117
<b>[glass shatters]</b>

09:25.777 --> 09:28.947
<b>Hey, what the hell
has your problem been</b>

09:28.997 --> 09:30.457
<b>since we got down here anyway?</b>

09:30.497 --> 09:31.457
<b>Nothing.</b>

09:31.497 --> 09:32.827
<b>Nothing my ass.</b>

09:32.867 --> 09:35.997
<b>Come on, I asked you what
your damn problem is!</b>

09:36.037 --> 09:39.047
<b>I'm busting my ass here,
and you keep going [tutting].</b>

09:39.087 --> 09:40.467
<b>I can hear you, you know!</b>

09:40.507 --> 09:42.377
<b>So what's your freaking
problem, huh?</b>

09:42.427 --> 09:45.387
<b>Whoa, whoa, whoa,
just calm down, both of you.</b>

09:45.427 --> 09:46.757
<b>There's no need
to get so worked up.</b>

09:46.797 --> 09:48.137
<b>[SUBARU]
Shut the hell up!</b>

09:48.177 --> 09:49.807
<b>Can't you see Ram
and I are trying to have</b>

09:49.847 --> 09:51.597
<b>a conversation over here?</b>

09:51.637 --> 09:53.017
<b>Go on.</b>

09:53.057 --> 09:54.687
<b>If there's something
you've been wanting to say,</b>

09:54.727 --> 09:55.897
<b>then let's hear it already.</b>

09:55.937 --> 09:57.517
<b>I'm all ears, so spit it out!</b>

09:57.567 --> 09:58.977
<b>You're so eager.</b>

09:59.017 --> 10:01.147
<b>All you want is to keep
moving forward, correct?</b>

10:01.187 --> 10:03.147
<b>Well, yeah,
damn straight, I am.</b>

10:03.197 --> 10:05.277
<b>What the hell do you think we
went through all this to do?</b>

10:05.317 --> 10:06.407
<b>We're gonna see the sage--</b>

10:06.447 --> 10:07.947
<b>[RAM]
Wrong.</b>

10:07.987 --> 10:09.987
<b>The reason we came here
was not to see the sage.</b>

10:10.037 --> 10:11.327
<b>Huh?</b>

10:11.367 --> 10:14.657
<b>We came here in order
to finally awaken Rem.</b>

10:16.327 --> 10:20.087
<b>And I came here so I could
remember my little sister.</b>

10:20.127 --> 10:21.297
<b>But look at us.</b>

10:21.337 --> 10:23.167
<b>What are we even doing now?</b>

10:23.217 --> 10:24.507
<b>Rem's not around.</b>

10:24.547 --> 10:26.637
<b>We're wandering aimlessly.</b>

10:26.677 --> 10:28.637
<b>No more games.</b>

10:28.677 --> 10:30.177
<b>I'm not playing any games!</b>

10:30.217 --> 10:31.717
<b>I can't help that
we ended up here.</b>

10:31.767 --> 10:33.477
<b>It's not my fault.</b>

10:33.517 --> 10:35.267
<b>How come when
we fell down here,</b>

10:35.307 --> 10:39.437
<b>you reached out and grabbed
me and not Rem instead?</b>

10:39.477 --> 10:42.817
<b>I'm sure you only thought about
what was right in front of you.</b>

10:42.857 --> 10:45.027
<b>You never think
about the big picture.</b>

10:45.067 --> 10:47.277
<b>Your head is full of
Ms. Emilia and Ms. Beatrice,</b>

10:47.317 --> 10:48.327
<b>and that's it.</b>

10:48.367 --> 10:50.157
<b>What kind of man are you?</b>

10:50.197 --> 10:51.657
<b>I feel sorry for Rem.</b>

10:51.697 --> 10:52.907
<b>Shut up.</b>

10:52.947 --> 10:55.577
<b>[RAM] Barusu,
didn't she believe in you?</b>

10:55.617 --> 10:56.827
<b>Quiet, you!</b>

10:56.867 --> 10:57.957
<b>[RAM]
No, I will not.</b>

10:57.997 --> 10:59.457
<b>If we're being honest,</b>

10:59.497 --> 11:01.837
<b>you don't actually care
about Rem at all, do you?</b>

11:01.877 --> 11:04.297
<b>Knock it off with that shit!</b>

11:04.337 --> 11:07.007
<b>[growling]</b>

11:07.047 --> 11:09.597
<b>Invisible Providence.</b>

11:10.847 --> 11:12.847
<b>[thud]</b>

11:12.887 --> 11:16.677
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

11:16.727 --> 11:22.687
<b>♪ ♪</b>

11:22.727 --> 11:24.737
<b>Quit screwing with me!</b>

11:24.777 --> 11:26.857
<b>This is all your
own damn fault.</b>

11:26.897 --> 11:29.697
<b>Your fault,
your fault, your fault!</b>

11:29.737 --> 11:32.237
<b>Do us all a favor
and die, bitch!</b>

11:32.277 --> 11:33.617
<b>You disgust me.</b>

11:33.657 --> 11:36.037
<b>It seriously makes
me sick to my stomach</b>

11:36.077 --> 11:38.287
<b>that you look so much like Rem!</b>

11:39.417 --> 11:40.377
<b>Huh?</b>

11:40.417 --> 11:42.417
<b>I can't hear you!</b>

11:42.457 --> 11:45.507
<b>If you still got something
you want to say, just say it.</b>

11:45.547 --> 11:49.217
<b>♪ ♪</b>

11:49.257 --> 11:50.677
<b>Ra.</b>

11:50.717 --> 11:53.717
<b>[explosion]</b>

11:55.767 --> 11:57.017
<b>Magic?</b>

11:57.057 --> 11:59.187
<b>Listen, you bitch,
it's too late to come</b>

11:59.227 --> 12:01.147
<b>crying and saying sorry now!</b>

12:01.187 --> 12:04.317
<b>If anybody should be
saying that, it's me.</b>

12:04.357 --> 12:07.107
<b>Someone like you doesn't
deserve to see Rem.</b>

12:07.147 --> 12:09.777
<b>I'll slice you apart
and leave you here to rot!</b>

12:09.817 --> 12:11.817
<b>Keep talking.</b>

12:11.867 --> 12:15.037
<b>[ANASTASIA]
All right, that's enough.</b>

12:15.077 --> 12:16.707
<b>[squelch]</b>

12:19.207 --> 12:20.957
<b>There was no stopping you two.</b>

12:20.997 --> 12:23.957
<b>Unfortunately, I had
to decide who'd be more useful.</b>

12:23.997 --> 12:25.587
<b>I apologize.</b>

12:27.167 --> 12:28.917
<b>You just-- why?</b>

12:28.967 --> 12:30.087
<b>[ANASTASIA]
What?</b>

12:30.127 --> 12:32.717
<b>You're the one asking me that?</b>

12:32.757 --> 12:34.467
<b>I could say things
were gonna end poorly</b>

12:34.507 --> 12:35.557
<b>if I let 'em be,</b>

12:35.597 --> 12:37.807
<b>so I figured
I'd give you a hand.</b>

12:37.847 --> 12:40.477
<b>Or could it be that you're
pissed because I stole</b>

12:40.517 --> 12:41.937
<b>your prey out from under you?</b>

12:41.977 --> 12:44.147
<b>And now you're coming for me?</b>

12:44.187 --> 12:47.357
<b>Fine, I'll let you get away
with smooth talking me for now,</b>

12:47.397 --> 12:48.737
<b>so whatever.</b>

12:48.777 --> 12:49.737
<b>Hmm.</b>

12:49.777 --> 12:51.617
<b>What a good choice.</b>

12:51.657 --> 12:54.527
<b>Oh, you're so very clever.</b>

12:54.577 --> 12:57.497
<b>I can let out a sigh
of relief, finally.</b>

12:57.537 --> 12:59.957
<b>So here, how about
a little handshake</b>

12:59.997 --> 13:03.627
<b>to show that we're gonna make
up and play nice from now on?</b>

13:03.667 --> 13:04.787
<b>Uh.</b>

13:04.837 --> 13:06.837
<b>Natsuki?</b>

13:06.877 --> 13:08.757
<b>Something wrong?</b>

13:08.797 --> 13:10.047
<b>No.</b>

13:11.127 --> 13:12.387
<b>Not at all.</b>

13:16.177 --> 13:17.307
<b>[ANASTASIA]
In that case.</b>

13:17.347 --> 13:19.517
<b>[slicing noise]</b>

13:21.767 --> 13:23.097
<b>[thud]</b>

13:25.187 --> 13:27.517
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

13:27.567 --> 13:28.937
<b>[squelching]</b>

13:28.987 --> 13:31.697
<b>[whimpers]</b>

13:31.737 --> 13:34.907
<b>[screams]</b>

13:34.947 --> 13:35.987
<b>[SUBARU]
Let me go!</b>

13:36.027 --> 13:36.987
<b>No.</b>

13:37.027 --> 13:38.827
<b>[screams]</b>

13:38.867 --> 13:40.287
<b>I don't want to die!</b>

13:40.327 --> 13:42.287
<b>You're already dead!</b>

13:42.327 --> 13:44.377
<b>There's nothing
I can do to help you.</b>

13:44.417 --> 13:49.377
<b>Damn it, why won't you just
hurry up and die already?</b>

13:50.917 --> 13:54.337
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

13:54.387 --> 13:56.177
<b>[screams]</b>

13:56.217 --> 14:03.017
<b>♪ ♪</b>

14:04.387 --> 14:06.307
<b>[heavy breathing]</b>

14:06.357 --> 14:10.937
<b>♪ ♪</b>

14:10.987 --> 14:13.027
<b>[ANASTASIA]
Don't leave me.</b>

14:13.067 --> 14:17.867
<b>♪ ♪</b>

14:17.907 --> 14:20.117
<b>[vomits]</b>

14:22.867 --> 14:23.957
<b>It's Ram.</b>

14:23.997 --> 14:25.707
<b>This is Ram's magic, I'm sure.</b>

14:25.747 --> 14:30.337
<b>The bitch must have managed
to survive somehow and--</b>

14:30.377 --> 14:33.257
<b>[crunching noise]</b>

14:33.297 --> 14:36.717
<b>♪ ♪</b>

14:36.757 --> 14:38.637
<b>Patrasche?</b>

14:38.677 --> 14:40.887
<b>You were alive this whole time?</b>

14:40.927 --> 14:41.847
<b>What's going on?</b>

14:41.887 --> 14:44.057
<b>Is Ram dead finally?</b>

14:44.097 --> 14:45.977
<b>No, it doesn't matter.</b>

14:46.017 --> 14:47.397
<b>Let me ride you.</b>

14:47.437 --> 14:48.437
<b>Huh?</b>

14:48.477 --> 14:49.857
<b>Did you hear me?</b>

14:49.897 --> 14:51.737
<b>Hey, come here!</b>

14:51.777 --> 14:53.067
<b>Now, damn it.</b>

14:53.107 --> 14:55.197
<b>Think you can just
disrespect me like that?</b>

14:55.237 --> 15:00.487
<b>♪ ♪</b>

15:00.527 --> 15:03.157
<b>Finally came
to your senses, I see.</b>

15:03.197 --> 15:04.247
<b>Heh.</b>

15:04.287 --> 15:09.707
<b>♪ ♪</b>

15:09.747 --> 15:11.247
<b>Huh?</b>

15:11.287 --> 15:12.957
<b>[clink]</b>

15:14.717 --> 15:16.917
<b>[screeches]</b>

15:17.637 --> 15:18.887
<b>[thud]</b>

15:24.557 --> 15:26.267
<b>[squelching]</b>

15:31.477 --> 15:33.647
<b>Barusu, Barusu.</b>

15:33.687 --> 15:34.937
<b>If you don't wake up soon,</b>

15:34.987 --> 15:37.777
<b>I'm just going
to burn off your eyelids.</b>

15:37.817 --> 15:40.737
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:40.777 --> 15:42.027
<b>[SUBARU]
I'm--</b>

15:43.617 --> 15:44.867
<b>Barusu?</b>

15:47.407 --> 15:49.627
<b>Pathetic, aren't you?</b>

15:49.667 --> 15:50.787
<b>Don't bite me.</b>

15:50.837 --> 15:53.207
<b>[groans]</b>

15:53.247 --> 15:54.917
<b>[retching]</b>

15:57.507 --> 15:58.797
<b>Thanks.</b>

15:58.837 --> 15:59.837
<b>I'm OK now.</b>

15:59.887 --> 16:01.217
<b>Good.</b>

16:01.257 --> 16:03.717
<b>Well, I'm so glad you're
feeling better now.</b>

16:03.757 --> 16:05.097
<b>Give me a break, will ya?</b>

16:05.137 --> 16:07.017
<b>[ANASTASIA]
Well, thank goodness.</b>

16:07.057 --> 16:09.977
<b>Finally bright eyed
and bushy tailed, are you?</b>

16:10.017 --> 16:11.187
<b>[RAM]
Thankfully.</b>

16:11.227 --> 16:12.857
<b>How did the surroundings look?</b>

16:12.897 --> 16:14.357
<b>Not ideal.</b>

16:14.397 --> 16:16.487
<b>I wasn't able to find an exit,
and none of the others</b>

16:16.527 --> 16:17.687
<b>seemed close by.</b>

16:17.737 --> 16:19.987
<b>Hey, Natsuki.</b>

16:20.027 --> 16:21.237
<b>What's the matter?</b>

16:22.327 --> 16:25.237
<b>I just wondered,
what is the miasma exactly?</b>

16:25.287 --> 16:26.747
<b>Huh?</b>

16:26.787 --> 16:29.117
<b>This place is technically
part of the dunes, right?</b>

16:29.157 --> 16:32.457
<b>Which means there's probably
some of that miasma here, too.</b>

16:32.497 --> 16:36.047
<b>To put it simply, miasma
is basically tainted mana.</b>

16:36.087 --> 16:37.467
<b>And what does it do to you?</b>

16:37.507 --> 16:38.877
<b>They say if you
get stuck in it,</b>

16:38.917 --> 16:40.507
<b>it'll eat away
at your body and mind</b>

16:40.547 --> 16:42.297
<b>until nothing's left of you.</b>

16:42.347 --> 16:43.507
<b>Well, can you fight it?</b>

16:43.547 --> 16:45.097
<b>Unfortunately,
our gates take in mana</b>

16:45.137 --> 16:46.927
<b>automatically by nature.</b>

16:46.977 --> 16:49.767
<b>So the only thing we can really
do to stop it from affecting us</b>

16:49.807 --> 16:51.687
<b>is to stay as far
away as possible</b>

16:51.727 --> 16:54.057
<b>from where
the miasma's thickest.</b>

16:55.977 --> 16:58.607
<b>The miasma was
responsible for that.</b>

16:58.647 --> 17:01.067
<b>So if we keep moving,
it'll happen again.</b>

17:01.107 --> 17:02.367
<b>No.</b>

17:05.657 --> 17:06.867
<b>Barusu?</b>

17:06.907 --> 17:08.157
<b>Let's go.</b>

17:09.907 --> 17:12.787
<b>[melancholy music]</b>

17:12.827 --> 17:18.707
<b>♪ ♪</b>

17:18.757 --> 17:20.377
<b>Let's take the tunnel
on the left.</b>

17:20.417 --> 17:21.677
<b>It's our best bet.</b>

17:25.637 --> 17:28.847
<b>Ms. Anastasia, the ceiling
gets lower in this part,</b>

17:28.887 --> 17:29.807
<b>so be careful.</b>

17:29.847 --> 17:31.057
<b>[ANASTASIA]
OK, got it.</b>

17:31.097 --> 17:32.597
<b>Thank you kindly.</b>

17:32.637 --> 17:34.937
<b>[SUBARU] Ram, the footing's
kind of unstable here,</b>

17:34.977 --> 17:36.477
<b>so watch your step.</b>

17:36.517 --> 17:38.357
<b>[RAM]
OK, understood.</b>

17:38.397 --> 17:40.817
<b>If you get cold,
don't be afraid to speak up.</b>

17:40.857 --> 17:43.407
<b>I'll lend you my cloak
if you want it.</b>

17:43.447 --> 17:44.447
<b>What?</b>

17:44.487 --> 17:45.447
<b>Why'd you stop?</b>

17:45.487 --> 17:46.527
<b>What's wrong?</b>

17:46.577 --> 17:47.947
<b>What's wrong with you?</b>

17:47.987 --> 17:50.537
<b>Why are you acting
creepy and considerate?</b>

17:50.577 --> 17:51.907
<b>What exactly are you plotting?</b>

17:51.957 --> 17:54.207
<b>I promise you,
I'm not plotting anything.</b>

17:54.247 --> 17:56.587
<b>I just want you both
to stay safe and healthy</b>

17:56.627 --> 17:58.047
<b>as possible, that's all.</b>

17:58.087 --> 17:59.337
<b>You're a pervert.</b>

17:59.377 --> 18:00.957
<b>That's not perverted.</b>

18:01.007 --> 18:03.547
<b>How is it any different from
how Julius acts all the time?</b>

18:03.587 --> 18:06.387
<b>Well, it's natural and
expected when Julius does it,</b>

18:06.427 --> 18:08.557
<b>but from you,
it feels sick, kinda.</b>

18:08.597 --> 18:09.807
<b>It just ain't right.</b>

18:09.847 --> 18:11.217
<b>[SUBARU]
Did you just say sick?</b>

18:13.767 --> 18:14.897
<b>[ANASTASIA]
The heck?</b>

18:14.937 --> 18:16.937
<b>Do you smell something funny?</b>

18:16.977 --> 18:19.817
<b>It smells like
something's on fire, yes.</b>

18:19.857 --> 18:20.977
<b>[SUBARU]
A smell?</b>

18:21.027 --> 18:22.817
<b>Here, I'll go and check it out.</b>

18:24.197 --> 18:26.277
<b>If something happens,
we're leaving you as bait, OK?</b>

18:26.317 --> 18:27.947
<b>So don't blame us.</b>

18:27.987 --> 18:29.037
<b>[SUBARU]
You know I'm gonna curse</b>

18:29.077 --> 18:30.447
<b>the hell out of if you do.</b>

18:30.487 --> 18:37.417
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:37.787 --> 18:39.247
<b>[screams]</b>

18:39.297 --> 18:41.167
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:41.207 --> 18:43.917
<b>[screams]</b>

18:43.967 --> 18:46.637
<b>[gushing noise]</b>

18:46.677 --> 18:53.517
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:53.557 --> 18:54.767
<b>Whoa, whoa, whoa.</b>

18:54.807 --> 18:56.057
<b>Ugh!</b>

18:57.807 --> 19:00.687
<b>[groans]</b>

19:00.727 --> 19:07.737
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:07.777 --> 19:10.657
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

19:10.697 --> 19:15.707
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:15.747 --> 19:18.627
<b>[thrilling music]</b>

19:18.667 --> 19:25.967
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:26.717 --> 19:29.097
<b>[screeches]</b>

19:29.137 --> 19:35.597
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:35.637 --> 19:37.097
<b>[roars]</b>

19:37.137 --> 19:41.607
<b>[screeches]</b>

19:41.647 --> 19:44.817
<b>[whooshing]</b>

19:47.897 --> 19:54.327
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:54.367 --> 19:55.617
<b>Stupid.</b>

19:56.577 --> 19:58.997
<b>[yells]</b>

19:59.037 --> 20:02.417
<b>[explosions]</b>

20:02.457 --> 20:06.377
<b>♪ ♪</b>

20:06.417 --> 20:08.927
<b>[screams]</b>

20:15.267 --> 20:16.557
<b>[RAM]
El Fula!</b>

20:19.267 --> 20:20.267
<b>Get up.</b>

20:20.307 --> 20:22.817
<b>You want to make Rem cry?</b>

20:22.857 --> 20:24.147
<b>Don't you dare die.</b>

20:24.187 --> 20:25.397
<b>Barusu!</b>

20:27.857 --> 20:31.527
<b>[screeches]</b>

20:31.567 --> 20:35.237
<b>Invisible Providence!</b>

20:35.287 --> 20:37.077
<b>El Fula!</b>

20:37.117 --> 20:40.787
<b>[swooshing noise]</b>

20:44.417 --> 20:45.417
<b>Barusu.</b>

20:45.457 --> 20:48.797
<b>[intense music]</b>

20:48.837 --> 20:52.297
<b>♪ ♪</b>

20:52.337 --> 20:54.297
<b>[thudding]</b>

20:54.347 --> 20:57.807
<b>[screeches]</b>

20:57.847 --> 21:00.187
<b>[groans]</b>

21:06.727 --> 21:08.897
<b>Why did you--</b>

21:10.147 --> 21:12.657
<b>I don't want Rem to cry.</b>

21:16.277 --> 21:18.657
<b>[whoosh]</b>

21:18.697 --> 21:21.457
<b>Come on,
don't be deadweight.</b>

21:21.497 --> 21:22.457
<b>No.</b>

21:22.497 --> 21:25.287
<b>[galloping noise]</b>

21:26.377 --> 21:27.377
<b>Move it.</b>

21:27.417 --> 21:31.047
<b>Get up,
Subaru Natsuki!</b>

21:32.757 --> 21:34.887
<b>[puncturing]</b>

21:47.317 --> 21:48.687
<b>Ram!</b>

21:50.687 --> 21:52.317
<b>[groans]</b>

22:07.797 --> 22:09.957
<b>[SHAULA]
I found you.</b>

22:10.007 --> 22:13.007
<b>[theme music]</b>

22:13.047 --> 22:15.677
<b>♪ ♪</b>
